SUMMARY:Special Event: Vidura Bandara Rajapaksa: The Paradise Gothic Tour
LOCATION:Goodnights Comedy Club\, 401 Woodburn Rd.\, Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Vidura Bandara Rajapaksa returns with  Paradise Gothic \, a sh
 arp\, darkly funny new hour exploring immigration\, “radical” buddhism\
 , and the absurdities of attempting to build a life within late-stage capit
 alism. With his trademark deadpan delivery and postcolonial wit\, Vidura ta
 kes on corporate tech culture\, spiritual burnout\, and the strange comedy 
 of trying to stay human in a world running by numbers. Smart\, subversive\,
  and quietly explosive\; this is Vidura at his most fearless.\n\nCouple's P
 ackage includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 pe
 r person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right
  to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive o
 r dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-at
